<%- include("../partials/head", { title: "สรุปข้อมูลการใช้บริการ | ฝ่ายทะเบียน มฟล." }) %>
<%- include("../partials/sidebar", { user, active }) %>
<%- include("../partials/header", { user, crumbKey: "crumb.dashboard", crumbFallback: "แดชบอร์ดสรุปข้อมูล / <strong>ภาพรวม</strong>" }) %>

  <main class="app-main">
    <div class="db-head">
      <div>
        <h1 class="page-title" data-i18n="dashboard.title">แดชบอร์ดสรุปข้อมูล</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle" data-i18n="db.subtitle">การใช้กระดาษของแต่ละหน่วยงาน</p>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="export-btn" id="dashboard-export-btn">
        <span class="icon" data-icon="download"><%- icon('download') %></span>
        <span class="export-btn-label" data-i18n="export.excel">ส่งออก Excel</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Every choice lives in this one card, in the order people ask:
         when, then who, then what kind. The results below follow it. -->
    <div class="card filter-panel db-filter-card">
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="filter-row db-period-row">
          <div class="filter-group">
            <div class="filter-head"><span class="filter-label" data-i18n="dashboard.filter.period">ช่วงเวลา</span></div>
            <div class="filter-controls db-period-controls">
              <div class="db-seg" id="db-mode" role="group">
                <button type="button" data-mode="all" data-i18n="db.mode.all">ทั้งหมด</button>
                <button type="button" data-mode="year" data-i18n="db.mode.year">รายปี</button>
                <button type="button" data-mode="fiscal" data-i18n="db.mode.fiscal">ปีงบประมาณ</button>
                <button type="button" data-mode="month" data-i18n="db.mode.month">รายเดือน</button>
                <button type="button" data-mode="range" data-i18n="db.mode.range">เลือกวันที่</button>
              </div>
              <div class="db-pick" id="db-pick-step" hidden>
                <button type="button" class="db-step is-prev" id="db-prev" data-i18n-title="db.step.prev" title="ก่อนหน้า" aria-label="ก่อนหน้า"><span class="icon" data-icon="chevron-down"><%- icon('chevron-down') %></span></button>
                <div class="dd" id="db-month"><button type="button" class="toolbar-select dd-btn" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="เดือน"><span class="dd-value"></span><span class="icon dd-chevron" data-icon="chevron-down"><%- icon('chevron-down') %></span></button><div class="dd-panel" hidden></div></div>
                <div class="dd" id="db-year"><button type="button" class="toolbar-select dd-btn" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="ปี"><span class="dd-value"></span><span class="icon dd-chevron" data-icon="chevron-down"><%- icon('chevron-down') %></span></button><div class="dd-panel" hidden></div></div>
                <button type="button" class="db-step is-next" id="db-next" data-i18n-title="db.step.next" title="ถัดไป" aria-label="ถัดไป"><span class="icon" data-icon="chevron-down"><%- icon('chevron-down') %></span></button>
              </div>
              <div class="db-pick" id="db-pick-range" hidden>
                <input type="date" id="db-from" class="toolbar-select" aria-label="ตั้งแต่วันที่">
                <span class="filter-to" data-i18n="dashboard.dateMode.rangeTo">ถึง</span>
                <input type="date" id="db-to" class="toolbar-select" aria-label="ถึงวันที่">
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="filter-row db-who-row">
          <div class="filter-group">
            <div class="filter-head"><span class="filter-label" data-i18n="db.f.unitGroup">หน่วยงาน</span></div>
            <div class="filter-controls">
              <div class="dd" id="db-type"><button type="button" class="toolbar-select dd-btn" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="ประเภทหน่วยงาน"><span class="dd-value"></span><span class="icon dd-chevron" data-icon="chevron-down"><%- icon('chevron-down') %></span></button><div class="dd-panel" hidden></div></div>
              <!-- searchable unit picker (a datalist could not search part of a name) -->
              <div class="db-combo" id="db-unit-combo">
                <button type="button" class="toolbar-select db-combo-btn" id="db-unit-btn" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false">
                  <span class="db-combo-value" id="db-unit-label">ทุกหน่วยงาน</span>
                  <span class="icon db-combo-chevron" data-icon="chevron-down"><%- icon('chevron-down') %></span>
                </button>
                <div class="db-combo-panel" id="db-unit-panel" hidden>
                  <input type="text" class="db-combo-search" id="db-unit-search" autocomplete="off" data-i18n-placeholder="db.f.unitSearch" placeholder="พิมพ์ชื่อหน่วยงาน (ไทยหรืออังกฤษ)">
                  <div class="db-combo-list" id="db-unit-options" role="listbox"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="filter-group">
            <div class="filter-head"><span class="filter-label" data-i18n="db.f.paperGroup">เอกสารและกระดาษ</span></div>
            <div class="filter-controls">
              <div class="dd" id="db-doc"><button type="button" class="toolbar-select dd-btn" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="ประเภทเอกสาร"><span class="dd-value"></span><span class="icon dd-chevron" data-icon="chevron-down"><%- icon('chevron-down') %></span></button><div class="dd-panel" hidden></div></div>
              <div class="dd" id="db-src"><button type="button" class="toolbar-select dd-btn" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="แหล่งที่มากระดาษ"><span class="dd-value"></span><span class="icon dd-chevron" data-icon="chevron-down"><%- icon('chevron-down') %></span></button><div class="dd-panel" hidden></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="db-loading" id="db-loading" data-i18n="db.loading">กำลังโหลดข้อมูล…</div>

    <div id="db-body" hidden>
      <!-- What is on screen, in words. Sticks under the header while scrolling. -->
      <div class="db-active" id="db-active">
        <div class="db-active-main">
          <span class="db-active-label" data-i18n="db.active.label">กำลังดู</span>
          <span class="db-active-period" id="db-active-period"></span>
          <div class="db-active-chips" id="db-active-chips"></div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary db-active-reset" id="db-active-reset" hidden>
          <span data-i18n="db.reset">ล้างตัวกรอง</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="db-kpis" id="db-kpis"></div>

      <div class="db-card">
        <div class="db-card-head">
          <div><h2 id="db-chart-title"></h2><div class="db-hint" id="db-chart-hint"></div></div>
          <div class="db-legend" id="db-chart-legend"></div>
        </div>
        <div id="db-chart"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="db-grid">
        <div class="db-card db-span-8">
          <div class="db-card-head"><div><h2 data-i18n="db.table.title">แยกตามหน่วยงาน</h2><div class="db-hint" data-i18n="db.table.hint">คลิกชื่อหน่วยงานเพื่อกรองเฉพาะหน่วยงานนั้น คลิกหัวคอลัมน์เพื่อเรียง</div></div></div>
          <div class="table-wrap"><table class="db-table" id="db-table"></table></div>
          <div class="db-table-more" id="db-table-more"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="db-span-4 db-side">
          <div class="db-card">
            <div class="db-card-head"><div><h2 id="db-share-title"></h2><div class="db-hint" id="db-share-hint"></div></div><button type="button" class="db-back-link" id="db-share-back" hidden><span class="icon" data-icon="arrow-left"><%- icon('arrow-left') %></span><span data-i18n="db.share.back">ทุกประเภท</span></button></div>
            <div id="db-share"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="db-card">
            <div class="db-card-head"><div><h2 data-i18n="db.split.title">สัดส่วนเอกสารและกระดาษ</h2><div class="db-hint" data-i18n="db.split.hint">คลิกเพื่อกรอง</div></div></div>
            <div id="db-splits"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <div class="db-tip" id="db-tip"></div>

<%- include("../partials/foot") %>
<script>
(function () {
  // The server counts (requests.dashboardRange); the page only draws.
  let O = null, R = null, seq = 0;
  const CAT = ["#2a78d6", "#eb6834", "#1baf7a", "#eda100", "#e87ba4"], OTHER = "#b9b1a8";
  const BLUE = "#2a78d6", PREV = "#8f8780";
  const cache = new Map();
  const state = { mode: "year", year: null, fy: null, month: 0, from: "", to: "", type: "", unit: "", doc: "", src: "", sort: "sheets", dir: -1, showAll: false };
  const byId = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
  const esc = (s) => escapeHtml(String(s));
  const lang = () => getLang();
  const months = () => (lang() === "en" ? ENG_MONTHS : THAI_MONTHS);
  const yl = (y) => (lang() === "en" ? String(y) : String(y + 543));
  const yearN = (y) => t("db.yearN").replace("{y}", yl(y));
  const fmt = (n) => Math.round(n).toLocaleString(lang() === "en" ? "en-US" : "th-TH");
  function short(n) {
    if (n >= 1e6) return (n / 1e6).toFixed(2).replace(/\.?0+$/, "") + (lang() === "en" ? "M" : " ล้าน");
    if (n >= 1e4) return Math.round(n / 1e3) + "K";
    return fmt(n);
  }
  function niceMax(v) {
    const raw = Math.max(1, v) / 4, p10 = Math.pow(10, Math.floor(Math.log10(raw)));
    return [1, 2, 2.5, 5, 10].map((m) => m * p10).find((m) => m >= raw) * 4;
  }
  const pct = (a, b) => (b ? (a - b) / b * 100 : null);
  const deltaHtml = (d) => (d == null || !isFinite(d) || Math.abs(d) < 0.05 ? "" : `<b class="${d >= 0 ? "is-up" : "is-down"}">${d >= 0 ? "▲" : "▼"} ${Math.abs(d).toFixed(1)}%</b>`);

  function unitLabel(stored) {
    const m = /^(.*?)\s*\(([^()]*)\)\s*$/.exec(stored || "");
    return m ? (lang() === "en" ? m[2] : m[1]) : stored;
  }
  const typeLabel = (th) => { const x = O && O.types.find((t0) => t0.th === th); return x && lang() === "en" ? x.en : th; };
  const VALUE_KEYS = {
    "ข้อสอบ": "dashboard.documentTypeFilter.exam", "เอกสารทั่วไป": "dashboard.documentTypeFilter.general",
    "ฝ่ายทะเบียนจัดเตรียมให้": "dashboard.paperSourceFilter.office", "ผู้ขอจัดเตรียมเอง": "dashboard.paperSourceFilter.requester"
  };
  const valueLabel = (v) => (VALUE_KEYS[v] ? t(VALUE_KEYS[v]) : v);

  // ---------------- days as "YYYY-MM-DD" strings ----------------
  const pad = (n) => String(n).padStart(2, "0");
  const ymd = (y, m, d) => `${y}-${pad(m)}-${pad(d)}`;
  const parts = (s) => s.split("-").map(Number);
  const lastDayOf = (y, m) => new Date(y, m, 0).getDate(); // m is 1-12
  const dayText = (s, withYear) => { const [y, m, d] = parts(s); return `${d} ${months()[m - 1]}` + (withYear ? ` ${yl(y)}` : ""); };
  // Thai fiscal year N runs 1 Oct of N-1 to 30 Sep of N
  const fyN = (y) => t("db.fyN").replace("{y}", yl(y));
  const rangeText = (from, to) => {
    const sep = " " + t("dashboard.dateMode.rangeTo") + " ";
    return from.slice(0, 4) === to.slice(0, 4) ? dayText(from, false) + sep + dayText(to, true) : dayText(from, true) + sep + dayText(to, true);
  };
  // the shortest way to say a period: "ปี 2569", "ต.ค. 2569", "1 ม.ค. ถึง 16 พ.ย. 2569"
  function periodText(from, to) {
    const [fy, fm, fd] = parts(from), [ty, tm, td] = parts(to);
    if (fm === 1 && fd === 1 && tm === 12 && td === 31 && fy === ty) return yearN(fy);
    if (fm === 10 && fd === 1 && tm === 9 && td === 30 && ty === fy + 1) return `${fyN(ty)} (${rangeText(from, to)})`;
    if (fd === 1 && fy === ty && fm === tm && td === lastDayOf(ty, tm)) return `${months()[fm - 1]} ${yl(fy)}`;
    if (from === to) return dayText(from, true);
    return rangeText(from, to);
  }

  // the period the controls describe, as from/to ("" = everything)
  function period() {
    if (state.mode === "all") return { from: "", to: "" };
    if (state.mode === "year") return { from: ymd(state.year, 1, 1), to: ymd(state.year, 12, 31) };
    if (state.mode === "fiscal") return { from: ymd(state.fy - 1, 10, 1), to: ymd(state.fy, 9, 30) };
    if (state.mode === "month") return { from: ymd(state.year, state.month + 1, 1), to: ymd(state.year, state.month + 1, lastDayOf(state.year, state.month + 1)) };
    return { from: state.from, to: state.to || state.from };
  }

  // ---------------- tooltip ----------------
  const tip = byId("db-tip");
  function bindTips(root) {
    root.querySelectorAll("[data-tip]").forEach((el) => {
      el.addEventListener("mouseenter", (e) => { tip.innerHTML = el.getAttribute("data-tip"); tip.style.display = "block"; move(e); });
      el.addEventListener("mousemove", move);
      el.addEventListener("mouseleave", () => { tip.style.display = "none"; });
    });
    function move(e) { tip.style.left = Math.min(e.clientX + 14, innerWidth - tip.offsetWidth - 8) + "px"; tip.style.top = (e.clientY + 14) + "px"; }
  }

  // ---------------- dropdown (.dd): button + tidy panel ----------------
  // A list (with a check on the chosen row) or, with `cols`, a grid of
  // equal tiles for years and months. Arrow keys, Enter and Esc work.
  //   items(): [{ v, label, disabled, now, sep }]   (sep: a line after it)
  //   value(): current v;  text(): button text;  title(): panel heading
  // Panels float above the page (position: fixed): as wide as their button
  // (at least minW), as tall as the room left on screen, and opening upwards
  // when there is little room below. They follow the button while scrolling.
  let placed = null;
  function placePanel(panel, anchor, minW) {
    // out of the card: its entrance transform would pin a fixed panel to the card
    if (panel.parentNode !== document.body) document.body.appendChild(panel);
    panel.classList.add("is-placed");
    const r = anchor.getBoundingClientRect();
    const head = (document.querySelector(".app-header") || { getBoundingClientRect: () => ({ bottom: 0 }) }).getBoundingClientRect().bottom;
    const below = innerHeight - r.bottom - 12, above = r.top - Math.max(8, head) - 12;
    const w = Math.min(innerWidth - 16, Math.max(r.width, minW));
    panel.style.width = w + "px";
    panel.style.maxHeight = "none";
    const natural = panel.offsetHeight;
    const up = natural > below && above > below;
    const room = Math.max(140, up ? above : below);
    panel.style.maxHeight = Math.min(natural, room) + "px";
    panel.style.left = Math.max(8, Math.min(r.left, innerWidth - 8 - w)) + "px";
    panel.style.top = (up ? r.top - 6 - panel.offsetHeight : r.bottom + 6) + "px";
    placed = { panel, anchor, minW };
  }
  window.addEventListener("scroll", (e) => {
    if (!placed || placed.panel.hidden) return;
    if (placed.panel.contains(e.target)) return;
    const r = placed.anchor.getBoundingClientRect();
    if (r.bottom < 0 || r.top > innerHeight) { if (openDD) openDD.close(); closeUnits(); }
    else placePanel(placed.panel, placed.anchor, placed.minW);
  }, true);
  window.addEventListener("resize", () => { if (openDD) openDD.close(); closeUnits(); });

  let openDD = null;
  function dropdown(id, cfg) {
    const root = byId(id), btn = root.querySelector(".dd-btn"), panel = root.querySelector(".dd-panel");
    panel.classList.toggle("is-grid", !!cfg.cols);
    const api = {
      sync() { root.querySelector(".dd-value").textContent = cfg.text(); btn.title = cfg.text(); },
      close(focus) { panel.hidden = true; btn.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false"); if (openDD === api) openDD = null; if (focus) btn.focus(); },
      open() {
        if (openDD) openDD.close();
        closeUnits();
        const list = cfg.items(), cur = String(cfg.value());
        const head = cfg.title ? `<div class="dd-title">${esc(cfg.title())}</div>` : "";
        const opts = list.map((it) => {
          const sel = String(it.v) === cur;
          return `<button type="button" class="dd-opt${sel ? " is-selected" : ""}${it.now ? " is-now" : ""}" role="option" aria-selected="${sel}" data-v="${esc(it.v)}"${it.disabled ? " disabled" : ""}>` +
            (cfg.cols ? "" : `<span class="dd-check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>`) + `<span class="dd-label">${esc(it.label)}</span></button>` +
            (it.sep ? `<div class="dd-sep"></div>` : "");
        }).join("");
        panel.innerHTML = head + `<div class="${cfg.cols ? "dd-grid" : "dd-list"}" role="listbox"${cfg.cols ? ` style="--cols:${cfg.cols}"` : ""}>${opts}</div>`;
        panel.hidden = false; btn.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "true"); openDD = api;
        // keep the panel on screen
        placePanel(panel, btn, cfg.cols ? 300 : 240);
        panel.querySelectorAll(".dd-opt").forEach((o) => o.addEventListener("click", () => {
          api.close(true);
          if (o.dataset.v !== cur) cfg.pick(o.dataset.v);
        }));
        const first = panel.querySelector(".dd-opt.is-selected:not(:disabled)") || panel.querySelector(".dd-opt:not(:disabled)");
        if (first) { first.focus(); first.scrollIntoView({ block: "nearest" }); }
      }
    };
    btn.addEventListener("click", () => (panel.hidden ? api.open() : api.close()));
    btn.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => { if (e.key === "ArrowDown" && panel.hidden) { e.preventDefault(); api.open(); } });
    panel.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
      const opts = Array.from(panel.querySelectorAll(".dd-opt:not(:disabled)"));
      const i = opts.indexOf(document.activeElement), cols = cfg.cols || 1;
      const move = { ArrowRight: cfg.cols ? 1 : 0, ArrowLeft: cfg.cols ? -1 : 0, ArrowDown: cols, ArrowUp: -cols }[e.key];
      if (e.key === "Escape") { e.preventDefault(); api.close(true); }
      else if (move) { e.preventDefault(); const n = opts[Math.min(opts.length - 1, Math.max(0, (i < 0 ? 0 : i + move)))]; if (n) n.focus(); }
      else if (e.key === "Tab") api.close();
    });
    document.addEventListener("mousedown", (e) => { if (!panel.hidden && !root.contains(e.target) && !panel.contains(e.target)) api.close(); });
    return api;
  }

  // ---------------- period controls ----------------
  const fFrom = byId("db-from"), fTo = byId("db-to");
  const todayY = () => Number(O.today.slice(0, 4));
  const todayM = () => Number(O.today.slice(5, 7)) - 1;
  const todayFY = () => (todayM() >= 9 ? todayY() + 1 : todayY());
  const firstY = () => Math.min(O.firstYear || todayY(), todayY());
  const ddYear = dropdown("db-year", {
    cols: 4,
    title: () => t(state.mode === "fiscal" ? "db.dd.fy" : "db.dd.year"),
    items: () => {
      const fiscal = state.mode === "fiscal", last = fiscal ? todayFY() : todayY(), out = [];
      for (let y = last; y >= firstY(); y--) out.push({ v: y, label: yl(y), now: y === last });
      return out;
    },
    value: () => (state.mode === "fiscal" ? state.fy : state.year),
    text: () => (state.mode === "fiscal" ? fyN(state.fy) : yearN(state.year)),
    pick: (v) => { if (state.mode === "fiscal") state.fy = +v; else state.year = +v; syncPeriod(); load(); }
  });
  const ddMonth = dropdown("db-month", {
    cols: 3,
    title: () => t("db.dd.month").replace("{y}", yl(state.year)),
    items: () => months().map((m, i) => ({ v: i, label: m, now: state.year === todayY() && i === todayM(), disabled: state.year > todayY() || (state.year === todayY() && i > todayM()) })),
    value: () => state.month,
    text: () => months()[state.month],
    pick: (v) => { state.month = +v; syncPeriod(); load(); }
  });
  function syncPeriod() {
    document.querySelectorAll("#db-mode [data-mode]").forEach((b) => {
      const on = b.dataset.mode === state.mode;
      b.classList.toggle("is-active", on); b.setAttribute("aria-pressed", on);
    });
    byId("db-pick-step").hidden = !["year", "fiscal", "month"].includes(state.mode);
    byId("db-month").hidden = state.mode !== "month";
    byId("db-pick-range").hidden = state.mode !== "range";
    if (state.mode === "month" && state.year === todayY() && state.month > todayM()) state.month = todayM();
    ddYear.sync(); ddMonth.sync();
    fFrom.value = state.from; fTo.value = state.to;
    fFrom.max = O.today; fTo.max = O.today;
    // no stepping past the current year / fiscal year / month, or before the first data
    let atEnd, atStart;
    if (state.mode === "fiscal") { atEnd = state.fy >= todayFY(); atStart = state.fy <= firstY(); }
    else if (state.mode === "year") { atEnd = state.year >= todayY(); atStart = state.year <= firstY(); }
    else { atEnd = state.year * 12 + state.month >= todayY() * 12 + todayM(); atStart = state.year <= firstY() && state.month === 0; }
    byId("db-next").disabled = atEnd; byId("db-prev").disabled = atStart;
  }
  function setMode(mode) {
    if (mode === state.mode) return;
    if (mode === "range" && !state.from) {
      // start from what was on screen
      const p = period();
      state.from = p.from || O.today.slice(0, 8) + "01";
      state.to = p.to && p.to < O.today ? p.to : O.today;
    }
    state.mode = mode;
    syncPeriod(); load();
  }
  document.querySelectorAll("#db-mode [data-mode]").forEach((b) => { b.onclick = () => setMode(b.dataset.mode); });
  function step(n) {
    if (state.mode === "year") state.year += n;
    else if (state.mode === "fiscal") state.fy += n;
    else { const k = state.year * 12 + state.month + n; state.year = Math.floor(k / 12); state.month = k % 12; }
    syncPeriod(); load();
  }
  byId("db-prev").onclick = () => step(-1);
  byId("db-next").onclick = () => step(1);
  // a start after the end moves the end along (and the other way round)
  function onRange(e) {
    state.from = fFrom.value; state.to = fTo.value;
    if (state.from && state.to && state.from > state.to) { if (e.target === fFrom) state.to = state.from; else state.from = state.to; }
    syncPeriod();
    if (state.from) load();
  }
  fFrom.onchange = onRange; fTo.onchange = onRange;
  function showYear(y) { state.mode = "year"; state.year = y; syncPeriod(); load(); }
  function showMonth(y, m) { state.mode = "month"; state.year = y; state.month = m; syncPeriod(); load(); }

  // ---------------- unit / document filters ----------------
  // "all" first with a line under it, then the choices
  const listOf = (allKey, values, label) => [{ v: "", label: t(allKey), sep: true }].concat(values.map((v) => ({ v, label: label(v) })));
  const ddType = dropdown("db-type", {
    items: () => listOf("dashboard.unitCategoryFilter.all", O.types.map((x) => x.th), typeLabel),
    value: () => state.type,
    text: () => (state.type ? typeLabel(state.type) : t("dashboard.unitCategoryFilter.all")),
    pick: (v) => { state.type = v; state.unit = ""; fillFilters(); load(); }
  });
  const ddDoc = dropdown("db-doc", {
    items: () => listOf("dashboard.documentTypeFilter.all", O.docs, valueLabel),
    value: () => state.doc,
    text: () => (state.doc ? valueLabel(state.doc) : t("dashboard.documentTypeFilter.all")),
    pick: (v) => { state.doc = v; fillFilters(); load(); }
  });
  const ddSrc = dropdown("db-src", {
    items: () => listOf("dashboard.paperSourceFilter.all", O.srcs, valueLabel),
    value: () => state.src,
    text: () => (state.src ? valueLabel(state.src) : t("dashboard.paperSourceFilter.all")),
    pick: (v) => { state.src = v; fillFilters(); load(); }
  });
  function fillFilters() { ddType.sync(); ddDoc.sync(); ddSrc.sync(); syncUnitButton(); }

  // ---- unit picker: button + panel with a search box and a grouped list ----
  const uBtn = byId("db-unit-btn"), uPanel = byId("db-unit-panel"), uSearch = byId("db-unit-search"), uList = byId("db-unit-options");
  let uItems = [], uActive = 0;
  function syncUnitButton() {
    const label = byId("db-unit-label");
    label.textContent = state.unit ? unitLabel(state.unit) : t("db.f.unitPh");
    uBtn.title = state.unit ? unitLabel(state.unit) : "";
  }
  const norm = (v) => String(v || "").toLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g, "");
  function renderUnitOptions() {
    const q = norm(uSearch.value);
    const pool = O.units.filter((u) => !state.type || u.type === state.type)
      .filter((u) => !q || norm(u.unit).includes(q) || norm(unitLabel(u.unit)).includes(q));
    const order = O.types.map((x) => x.th);
    pool.sort((a, b) => (order.indexOf(a.type) - order.indexOf(b.type)) || unitLabel(a.unit).localeCompare(unitLabel(b.unit), "th"));
    uItems = q ? pool : [{ unit: "" }].concat(pool);
    if (uActive >= uItems.length) uActive = 0;
    let html = "", lastType = null;
    uItems.forEach((u, i) => {
      if (u.unit && !state.type && u.type !== lastType) { lastType = u.type; html += `<div class="db-combo-group">${esc(typeLabel(u.type))}</div>`; }
      const sel = state.unit === u.unit;
      html += `<div class="db-combo-option${i === uActive ? " is-active" : ""}${sel ? " is-selected" : ""}" role="option" aria-selected="${sel}" data-i="${i}">${esc(u.unit ? unitLabel(u.unit) : t("db.f.unitPh"))}</div>`;
    });
    uList.innerHTML = html || `<div class="db-combo-empty">${esc(t("db.f.unitNone"))}</div>`;
    uList.querySelectorAll(".db-combo-option").forEach((el) => {
      el.addEventListener("mousedown", (e) => { e.preventDefault(); chooseUnit(+el.dataset.i); });
      el.addEventListener("mousemove", () => { if (uActive !== +el.dataset.i) { uActive = +el.dataset.i; markActive(); } });
    });
  }
  function markActive() {
    uList.querySelectorAll(".db-combo-option").forEach((el) => el.classList.toggle("is-active", +el.dataset.i === uActive));
    const el = uList.querySelector(".db-combo-option.is-active");
    if (el) el.scrollIntoView({ block: "nearest" });
  }
  function openUnits() {
    if (openDD) openDD.close();
    uPanel.hidden = false; uBtn.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "true");
    uSearch.value = "";
    renderUnitOptions();
    placePanel(uPanel, uBtn, 340);
    uActive = Math.max(0, uItems.findIndex((u) => u.unit === state.unit)); markActive();
    uSearch.focus();
  }
  function closeUnits() { uPanel.hidden = true; uBtn.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false"); }
  function chooseUnit(i) {
    const u = uItems[i];
    if (!u) return;
    closeUnits(); uBtn.focus();
    if (u.unit !== state.unit) pickUnit(u.unit, true);
  }
  uBtn.addEventListener("click", () => (uPanel.hidden ? openUnits() : closeUnits()));
  uSearch.addEventListener("input", () => { uActive = 0; renderUnitOptions(); placePanel(uPanel, uBtn, 340); });
  uSearch.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
    if (e.key === "ArrowDown") { e.preventDefault(); uActive = Math.min(uItems.length - 1, uActive + 1); markActive(); }
    else if (e.key === "ArrowUp") { e.preventDefault(); uActive = Math.max(0, uActive - 1); markActive(); }
    else if (e.key === "Enter") { e.preventDefault(); chooseUnit(uActive); }
    else if (e.key === "Escape") { e.preventDefault(); closeUnits(); uBtn.focus(); }
  });
  document.addEventListener("mousedown", (e) => { if (!uPanel.hidden && !byId("db-unit-combo").contains(e.target) && !uPanel.contains(e.target)) closeUnits(); });
  function pickUnit(stored, set) {
    state.unit = set ? stored : (state.unit === stored ? "" : stored);
    syncUnitButton(); load();
  }
  function clearFilters(keys) {
    keys.forEach((k) => { state[k] = ""; });
    if (keys.includes("type")) state.unit = "";
    fillFilters(); load();
  }
  byId("db-active-reset").onclick = () => clearFilters(["type", "unit", "doc", "src"]);
  byId("db-share-back").onclick = () => clearFilters(["type"]);

  byId("dashboard-export-btn").addEventListener("click", function () {
    const p = new URLSearchParams(), pr = period();
    if (pr.from) { p.set("fromDate", pr.from); p.set("toDate", pr.to); }
    if (state.type) p.set("unitType", state.type);
    if (state.unit) p.set("unit", state.unit);
    if (state.doc) p.set("documentType", state.doc);
    if (state.src) p.set("paperSource", state.src);
    downloadReport("/api/reports/dashboard.xlsx?" + p.toString(), this);
  });

  // ---------------- data ----------------
  function query() {
    const p = new URLSearchParams(), pr = period();
    if (pr.from) { p.set("from", pr.from); p.set("to", pr.to); }
    if (state.type) p.set("unitType", state.type);
    if (state.unit) p.set("unit", state.unit);
    if (state.doc) p.set("documentType", state.doc);
    if (state.src) p.set("paperSource", state.src);
    return p.toString();
  }
  async function load() {
    const my = ++seq, q = query();
    byId("db-body").classList.add("is-busy");
    try {
      let data = cache.get(q);
      if (!data) {
        const res = await fetch("/api/dashboard-range?" + q);
        if (!res.ok) throw new Error(res.status);
        data = await res.json();
        if (cache.size > 40) cache.clear();
        cache.set(q, data);
      }
      if (my !== seq) return;
      R = data;
      byId("db-loading").hidden = true; byId("db-body").hidden = false;
      render();
    } catch (e) {
      if (my === seq) { byId("db-loading").hidden = false; byId("db-loading").textContent = t("db.loadError"); }
    } finally {
      if (my === seq) byId("db-body").classList.remove("is-busy");
    }
  }

  // ---------------- "กำลังดู" bar ----------------
  const running = () => R.upTo < R.to;
  function nowText() {
    const base = R.allTime ? t("db.mode.allSpan").replace("{a}", dayText(R.from, true)).replace("{b}", dayText(R.upTo, true)) : periodText(R.from, R.to);
    return !R.allTime && running() ? base + " " + t("db.upTo").replace("{d}", dayText(R.upTo, false)) : base;
  }
  const prevText = () => (R.prev ? periodText(R.prev.from, R.prev.to) : "");
  function renderActive() {
    byId("db-active-period").textContent = nowText();
    const chips = [];
    const chip = (key, label) => `<span class="db-chip"><span class="db-chip-text" title="${esc(label)}">${esc(label)}</span><button type="button" data-clear="${key}" aria-label="${esc(t("db.active.remove"))}">✕</button></span>`;
    if (state.type) chips.push(chip("type", typeLabel(state.type)));
    if (state.unit) chips.push(chip("unit", unitLabel(state.unit)));
    if (state.doc) chips.push(chip("doc", valueLabel(state.doc)));
    if (state.src) chips.push(chip("src", valueLabel(state.src)));
    byId("db-active-chips").innerHTML = chips.join("");
    byId("db-active-reset").hidden = !chips.length;
    byId("db-active-chips").querySelectorAll("[data-clear]").forEach((b) => { b.onclick = () => clearFilters([b.dataset.clear]); });
  }

  // ---------------- KPI tiles ----------------
  function renderKpis() {
    const A = R.totals, B = R.prevTotals;
    const avg = (x) => (x && x.requests ? x.sheets / x.requests : 0);
    function tile(label, a, b, show, valueHtml) {
      let line = "";
      if (B) line = b ? `<span>${esc(t("db.cmp.prevLabel"))} ${show(b)}</span>${deltaHtml(pct(a, b))}` : `<span class="db-kpi-muted">${esc(t("db.noPrev"))}</span>`;
      return `<div class="db-card"><div class="db-kpi-label">${esc(label)}</div><div class="db-kpi-value">${valueHtml || show(a)}</div>` +
        (line ? `<div class="db-kpi-cmp">${line}</div>` : "") + `</div>`;
    }
    let html = tile(t("db.kpi.sheets"), A.sheets, B && B.sheets, fmt) +
      tile(t("db.kpi.req"), A.requests, B && B.requests, fmt) +
      tile(t("db.kpi.avg"), avg(A), B && avg(B), fmt);
    if (R.rank) {
      const r = R.rank;
      html += `<div class="db-card"><div class="db-kpi-label">${esc(t("db.kpi.rank"))}</div><div class="db-kpi-value">${r.pos ? `${r.pos}<small> / ${r.total}</small>` : "-"}</div><div class="db-kpi-cmp"><span>${esc(t("db.kpi.rankOf"))}</span></div></div>`;
    } else html += tile(t("db.kpi.units"), A.units, B && B.units, fmt);
    byId("db-kpis").innerHTML = html;
  }

  // ---------------- main chart: columns per day / month / year ----------------
  function bucketLabel(k, long) {
    const [y, m, d] = parts(k);
    if (R.bucket === "year") return long ? yearN(y) : yl(y);
    if (R.bucket === "month") {
      const crosses = R.from.slice(0, 4) !== R.to.slice(0, 4);
      return long || crosses ? `${months()[m - 1]} ${long ? yl(y) : yl(y).slice(-2)}` : months()[m - 1];
    }
    return long ? dayText(k, true) : String(d);
  }
  function renderChart() {
    const S = R.series, n = S.length, hasPrev = !!R.prev;
    byId("db-chart-title").textContent = t("db.chart." + R.bucket);
    // what the dashed line means, then what a click does
    byId("db-chart-hint").textContent = [hasPrev ? t("db.chart.readHint") : "", R.bucket === "year" ? t("db.chart.hintYear") : R.bucket === "month" ? t("db.chart.hintMonth") : ""].filter(Boolean).join(" ");
    byId("db-chart-legend").innerHTML = hasPrev
      ? `<span><i class="is-bar" style="background:${BLUE}"></i>${esc(t("db.legend.now"))}</span><span title="${esc(prevText())}"><i class="is-dash"></i>${esc(t("db.legend.prev"))}</span>` : "";
    const el = byId("db-chart");
    if (!n) { el.innerHTML = `<div class="db-empty">${esc(t("db.noData"))}</div>`; return; }
    const vals = S.map((s) => s.sheets || 0), pv = S.map((s) => s.prev || 0);
    const W = 1000, H = 300, L = 60, Rm = 16, T = 24, B = 34;
    const max = niceMax(Math.max(...vals, ...(hasPrev ? pv : [0])) * 1.08);
    const slot = (W - L - Rm) / n, bw = Math.min(64, slot * 0.62);
    const y = (v) => T + (1 - v / max) * (H - T - B);
    const cx = (i) => L + slot * i + slot / 2;
    let g = "";
    for (let k = 0; k <= 4; k++) { const v = (max / 4) * k; g += `<line x1="${L}" x2="${W - Rm}" y1="${y(v)}" y2="${y(v)}" stroke="#ece7e0"/><text x="${L - 8}" y="${y(v) + 4}" font-size="11" fill="#7a716a" text-anchor="end">${short(v)}</text>`; }
    const every = Math.max(1, Math.ceil(n / 16));
    const peak = vals.indexOf(Math.max(...vals));
    const click = R.bucket !== "day";
    // value labels are drawn last, with an outline, so the dashed line never covers them
    let labels = "";
    S.forEach((s, i) => {
      const v = vals[i], top = y(v), h = H - B - top, x = cx(i) - bw / 2;
      let tipHtml = `<b>${esc(bucketLabel(s.k, true))}</b><br>`;
      if (s.sheets == null) tipHtml += esc(t("db.chart.future"));
      else {
        tipHtml += `${fmt(v)} ${esc(t("db.sheetsUnit"))} (${fmt(s.requests)} ${esc(t("db.reqUnit"))})`;
        if (hasPrev) tipHtml += `<br>${esc(t("db.legend.prevShort"))} ${fmt(pv[i])} ${esc(t("db.sheetsUnit"))} ${deltaHtml(pct(v, pv[i]))}`;
      }
      if (click && s.sheets != null) tipHtml += `<br><span class="db-tip-hint">${esc(t(R.bucket === "year" ? "db.chart.clickYear" : "db.chart.clickMonth"))}</span>`;
      g += `<g class="db-col${click && s.sheets != null ? " is-click" : ""}" data-i="${i}" data-tip="${esc(tipHtml)}"><rect x="${L + slot * i}" y="${T}" width="${slot}" height="${H - T - B}" fill="transparent"/>` +
        (h > 0 ? `<path d="M${x} ${H - B} V${top + 3} Q${x} ${top} ${x + 3} ${top} H${x + bw - 3} Q${x + bw} ${top} ${x + bw} ${top + 3} V${H - B}Z" fill="${BLUE}"/>` : "") +
        ((n - 1 - i) % every === 0 ? `<text x="${cx(i)}" y="${H - 10}" font-size="11.5" fill="#7a716a" text-anchor="middle">${esc(bucketLabel(s.k, false))}</text>` : "") + `</g>`;
    });
    S.forEach((s, i) => {
      const v = vals[i];
      if (!((n <= 14 || i === peak) && v > 0)) return;
      // tall bar: white number inside its top; short bar: just above it
      const top = y(v), inside = H - B - top >= 26;
      labels += `<text class="db-val${inside ? " is-in" : ""}" x="${cx(i)}" y="${inside ? top + 16 : Math.max(12, top - 7)}" text-anchor="middle">${short(v)}</text>`;
    });
    // same stretch a year earlier: dashed line over the columns
    let prevPath = "";
    if (hasPrev) {
      prevPath = S.map((s, i) => (s.prev == null ? "" : (i && S[i - 1].prev != null ? "L" : "M") + cx(i).toFixed(1) + " " + y(s.prev).toFixed(1))).join(" ");
      prevPath = n > 1 ? `<path d="${prevPath}" fill="none" stroke="${PREV}" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 4" pointer-events="none"/>`
        : `<line x1="${cx(0) - bw / 2 - 6}" x2="${cx(0) + bw / 2 + 6}" y1="${y(pv[0])}" y2="${y(pv[0])}" stroke="${PREV}" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 4" pointer-events="none"/>`;
      if (n > 1 && n <= 40) prevPath += S.map((s, i) => (s.prev == null ? "" : `<circle cx="${cx(i).toFixed(1)}" cy="${y(s.prev).toFixed(1)}" r="2.5" fill="#fff" stroke="${PREV}" stroke-width="1.5" pointer-events="none"/>`)).join("");
    }
    el.innerHTML = `<svg viewBox="0 0 ${W} ${H}" width="100%" role="img" aria-label="${esc(byId("db-chart-title").textContent)}"><line x1="${L}" x2="${W - Rm}" y1="${H - B}" y2="${H - B}" stroke="#d8d2ca"/>${g}${prevPath}${labels}</svg>`;
    bindTips(el);
    if (click) el.querySelectorAll(".db-col.is-click").forEach((c) => c.addEventListener("click", () => {
      tip.style.display = "none";
      const [yy, mm] = parts(S[+c.dataset.i].k);
      if (R.bucket === "year") showYear(yy); else showMonth(yy, mm - 1);
    }));
  }

  // ---------------- units table ----------------
  function renderTable() {
    const hasPrev = !!R.prev;
    const list = R.units.filter((e) => e.sheets > 0).map((e) => ({ ...e, name: unitLabel(e.unit), chg: e.prev ? (e.sheets - e.prev) / e.prev * 100 : Infinity }));
    const k = state.sort === "chg" && !hasPrev ? "sheets" : state.sort, dir = state.dir;
    list.sort((p, q) => (k === "name" ? p.name.localeCompare(q.name, "th") * dir : (q[k] - p[k]) * -dir) || (q.sheets - p.sheets));
    const total = list.reduce((s, e) => s + e.sheets, 0) || 1;
    const max = Math.max(1, ...list.map((e) => e.sheets));
    const rows = state.showAll ? list : list.slice(0, 10);
    const head = (key, label, cls) => `<th class="${cls || ""}"><button type="button" class="db-sort${k === key ? " is-active" : ""}" data-k="${key}">${esc(label)}${k === key ? (dir < 0 ? " ↓" : " ↑") : ""}</button></th>`;
    let html = `<thead><tr><th class="db-col-n">#</th>${head("name", t("db.table.unit"))}${head("requests", t("db.kpi.req"), "db-num db-col-req")}${head("sheets", t("db.kpi.sheets"), "db-num")}` +
      (hasPrev ? head("chg", t("db.table.vsPrev"), "db-num") : "") + `</tr></thead><tbody>`;
    if (!rows.length) html += `<tr><td colspan="5" class="db-empty">${esc(t("db.noData"))}</td></tr>`;
    rows.forEach((e, i) => {
      const chg = e.chg === Infinity ? `<span class="db-kpi-muted">${esc(t("db.table.new"))}</span>` : (deltaHtml(e.chg) || "0%");
      html += `<tr class="${state.unit === e.unit ? "is-selected" : ""}"><td class="db-col-n">${i + 1}</td>` +
        `<td class="db-name"><button type="button" class="db-unit-link" data-i="${list.indexOf(e)}" title="${esc(e.name)}">${esc(e.name)}</button>` +
        `<div class="db-bars"><span class="db-bar-a" style="width:${(e.sheets / max * 100).toFixed(1)}%"></span></div></td>` +
        `<td class="db-num db-col-req">${fmt(e.requests)}</td>` +
        `<td class="db-num"><b>${fmt(e.sheets)}</b><small>${(e.sheets / total * 100).toFixed(1)}%</small></td>` +
        (hasPrev ? `<td class="db-num">${chg}</td>` : "") + `</tr>`;
    });
    const table = byId("db-table");
    table.innerHTML = html + "</tbody>";
    table.querySelectorAll(".db-sort").forEach((b) => { b.onclick = () => { if (state.sort === b.dataset.k) state.dir = -state.dir; else { state.sort = b.dataset.k; state.dir = b.dataset.k === "name" ? 1 : -1; } renderTable(); }; });
    table.querySelectorAll(".db-unit-link").forEach((b) => { b.onclick = () => pickUnit(list[+b.dataset.i].unit); });
    const more = byId("db-table-more");
    more.innerHTML = list.length > 10 ? `<button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" id="db-more-btn">${esc(state.showAll ? t("db.table.less") : t("db.table.all").replace("{n}", list.length))}</button>` : "";
    if (list.length > 10) byId("db-more-btn").onclick = () => { state.showAll = !state.showAll; renderTable(); };
  }

  // ---------------- donut: unit types (or units inside the chosen type) ----------------
  function renderShare() {
    const byType = !state.type;
    const all = (byType ? R.types.map((x) => ({ k: x.type, v: x.sheets })) : R.units.filter((u) => !state.unit || u.unit === state.unit).map((u) => ({ k: u.unit, v: u.sheets })))
      .filter((x) => x.v > 0).sort((a, b) => b.v - a.v);
    const total = all.reduce((s0, x) => s0 + x.v, 0);
    const parts0 = all.slice(0, 5).map((x, i) => ({ ...x, color: CAT[i], name: byType ? typeLabel(x.k) : unitLabel(x.k) }));
    const rest = all.slice(5).reduce((s0, x) => s0 + x.v, 0);
    if (rest > 0) parts0.push({ k: null, v: rest, color: OTHER, name: t("db.share.other").replace("{n}", all.length - 5) });
    byId("db-share-title").textContent = byType ? t("db.share.byType") : t("db.share.inType").replace("{name}", typeLabel(state.type));
    byId("db-share-hint").textContent = byType ? t("db.share.hintType") : t("db.share.hintUnit");
    byId("db-share-back").hidden = byType;
    const el = byId("db-share");
    if (!total) { el.innerHTML = `<div class="db-empty">${esc(t("db.noData"))}</div>`; return; }
    const R0 = 70, r0 = 44, C = 80;
    let ang = -Math.PI / 2, arcs = "";
    parts0.forEach((p, i) => {
      const a2 = ang + (p.v / total) * Math.PI * 2;
      const large = a2 - ang > Math.PI ? 1 : 0;
      const pt = (r, a) => `${(C + r * Math.cos(a)).toFixed(2)} ${(C + r * Math.sin(a)).toFixed(2)}`;
      const d = parts0.length === 1 ? `M${pt(R0, 0)} A${R0} ${R0} 0 1 1 ${pt(R0, Math.PI)} A${R0} ${R0} 0 1 1 ${pt(R0, 0)} M${pt(r0, 0)} A${r0} ${r0} 0 1 0 ${pt(r0, Math.PI)} A${r0} ${r0} 0 1 0 ${pt(r0, 0)}Z`
        : `M${pt(R0, ang)} A${R0} ${R0} 0 ${large} 1 ${pt(R0, a2)} L${pt(r0, a2)} A${r0} ${r0} 0 ${large} 0 ${pt(r0, ang)}Z`;
      arcs += `<path class="db-arc${p.k == null ? "" : " is-click"}" data-i="${i}" d="${d}" fill="${p.color}" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" fill-rule="evenodd" data-tip="${esc(`<b>${esc(p.name)}</b><br>${fmt(p.v)} ${esc(t("db.sheetsUnit"))} (${(p.v / total * 100).toFixed(1)}%)`)}"/>`;
      ang = a2;
    });
    const center = `<text x="${C}" y="${C - 2}" text-anchor="middle" font-size="15" font-weight="700" fill="#262220">${short(total)}</text><text x="${C}" y="${C + 15}" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10.5" fill="#7a716a">${esc(t("db.sheetsUnit"))}</text>`;
    el.innerHTML = `<div class="db-share"><svg viewBox="0 0 160 160" class="db-donut" role="img" aria-label="${esc(byId("db-share-title").textContent)}">${arcs}${center}</svg>` +
      `<div class="db-share-legend">` + parts0.map((p, i) => `<button type="button" class="db-share-row${p.k == null ? " is-static" : ""}" data-i="${i}"><span class="db-swatch" style="background:${p.color}"></span><span class="db-share-name" title="${esc(p.name)}">${esc(p.name)}</span><b>${(p.v / total * 100).toFixed(0)}%</b></button>`).join("") + `</div></div>`;
    bindTips(el);
    const pick = (i) => { const p = parts0[i]; if (!p || p.k == null) return; tip.style.display = "none"; if (byType) { state.type = p.k; state.unit = ""; fillFilters(); load(); } else pickUnit(p.k); };
    el.querySelectorAll(".db-arc.is-click, .db-share-row:not(.is-static)").forEach((n) => n.addEventListener("click", () => pick(+n.dataset.i)));
  }

  // ---------------- 100% bars: document type, paper source ----------------
  function renderSplits() {
    function block(title, list, key) {
      const total = list.reduce((s0, x) => s0 + x.sheets, 0) || 1;
      const segs = list.map((x, i) => {
        const p = x.sheets / total * 100;
        return p <= 0 ? "" : `<div class="db-split-seg" style="flex:${x.sheets};background:${CAT[i] || OTHER}" data-key="${key}" data-v="${esc(x.value)}" data-tip="${esc(`<b>${esc(valueLabel(x.value))}</b><br>${fmt(x.sheets)} ${esc(t("db.sheetsUnit"))} (${p.toFixed(1)}%)`)}">${p >= 12 ? p.toFixed(0) + "%" : ""}</div>`;
      }).join("");
      const legend = list.map((x, i) => `<span><span class="db-swatch" style="background:${CAT[i] || OTHER}"></span>${esc(valueLabel(x.value))}<b>${short(x.sheets)}</b></span>`).join("");
      return `<div class="db-split"><div class="db-split-title">${esc(title)}</div><div class="db-split-bar">${segs}</div><div class="db-split-legend">${legend}</div></div>`;
    }
    const el = byId("db-splits");
    el.innerHTML = block(t("dashboard.documentTypeFilter"), R.docs, "doc") + block(t("dashboard.paperSourceFilter"), R.srcs, "src");
    bindTips(el);
    el.querySelectorAll(".db-split-seg").forEach((n) => n.addEventListener("click", () => {
      tip.style.display = "none";
      const k = n.dataset.key, v = n.dataset.v;
      state[k] = state[k] === v ? "" : v;
      fillFilters();
      load();
    }));
  }

  function render() {
    if (!R) return;
    renderActive(); renderKpis(); renderChart(); renderTable(); renderShare(); renderSplits();
  }

  document.addEventListener("odprs:langchange", function () { if (!O) return; syncPeriod(); fillFilters(); render(); });

  fetch("/api/dashboard-options").then((res) => res.json()).then((opts) => {
    O = opts;
    state.year = todayY(); state.month = todayM(); state.fy = todayFY();
    syncPeriod(); fillFilters(); load();
  }).catch(() => { byId("db-loading").textContent = t("db.loadError"); });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
